    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "## Problem\nDUNCAN Fortress R01 proves durable/rebuildable Night School context, but fresh 2026-09-02 evidence exposed a missing runtime boundary: live sessions were not required to consume `DUNCAN_CONTEXT_NEXT.json` before selecting tools/actions. Persistence PASS was therefore being mistaken for runtime-learning PASS.\n\n## Minimal repair\n- add `docs/DUNCAN_RUNTIME_LEARNING_CONTEXT_R01.md`;\n- make AGENTS bootstrap require fresh read of validated `DUNCAN_CONTEXT_NEXT.json` before substantive action selection;\n- require `OWNER_INTENT -> DURABLE_STATE -> RELEVANT_LEARNING -> ANTI_REGRESSION_CHECK -> ACTION`;\n- apply direct OWNER corrections immediately; Night School consolidates later;\n- add regression test for the bootstrap hook and known 2026-09-02 failure classes.\n\n## Fresh learning evidence\nManual Night School regression report PR #111 comment `5506834354` was accepted by Permanent Archive V1. `DUNCAN_CONTEXT_NEXT.latest_cycle_id = DNR01-20260902-011`; `owner_intent_execution_discipline = FAILED`; SELF_MODEL now contains learning-consumption/tool-classification/simple-goal/immediate-correction rules.\n\n## Boundaries\n- no model-weight mutation;\n- no PRIME_CORE mutation;\n- no canon/production authority expansion;\n- no new memory DB/framework/service;\n- existing Permanent Archive + existing AGENTS bootstrap only.\n\nSTATUS = CANDIDATE / NOT PASS / NOT MERGED\n",
